        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Light blue taffeta ground with incomplete design of white ribbon serpentine with minute polychrome flowers scattered over it. Spray of larger flowers across serpentine at regular intervals. Small-scale landscape with two pagodas under trees, brocaded in white; small dots and zigzags in ground fabric. Component a: has part of right selvage present - flower pot with dwarf tree above landscape."@en ;
